---
import GovLayout from '../../layouts/GovLayout.astro';
import PhaseBanner from '../../components/PhaseBanner.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import SummaryBox from '../../components/SummaryBox.astro';
import InsetText from '../../components/InsetText.astro';
import Sidebar from '../../components/Sidebar.astro';
---
<GovLayout title="Universal Basic Income" department="Ministry of Social Welfare" description="UBI payment rates, eligibility, and auto-repayment rules.">

<PhaseBanner tag="Policy" text="Published 24 March 2026" />
<Breadcrumbs items={[
  { label: "Social Welfare", href: "/welfare" },
  { label: "Universal Basic Income", href: "/welfare/ubi" },
]} />

<main class="govuk-main-wrapper">
  <div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
      <h1>Universal Basic Income</h1>

      <SummaryBox title="Summary">
        <p>Every eligible online citizen receives a regular income payment from the government. The amount depends on activity level, driver level, and government employment status.</p>
      </SummaryBox>

      <h2 id="rates">1. Payment Rates</h2>
      <p>UBI is distributed every 20 minutes to all eligible online players. The table below shows the equivalent hourly rate (paid in 3 instalments):</p>

      <table class="govuk-table govuk-table--numeric">
        <caption>UBI Payment Schedule</caption>
        <thead><tr><th>Status</th><th>Per Payment</th><th>Hourly Total</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td style="text-align:left">Active player</td><td>$6,000</td><td>$18,000</td><td style="text-align:left">Currently driving or doing activities</td></tr>
          <tr><td style="text-align:left">AFK player</td><td>$2,000</td><td>$6,000</td><td style="text-align:left">Online but idle</td></tr>
          <tr><td style="text-align:left">Government employee (active)</td><td>$12,000</td><td>$36,000</td><td style="text-align:left">2× standard rate; logged as <em>Government Salary</em></td></tr>
          <tr><td style="text-align:left">Government employee (AFK)</td><td>$4,000</td><td>$12,000</td><td style="text-align:left">2× AFK rate; logged as <em>Government Salary</em></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 id="eligibility">2. Eligibility</h2>
      <p>To receive UBI a citizen must:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Have a <strong>driver level of 1 or above</strong> — level 0 players are excluded.</li>
        <li>Not have opted out of UBI (<code>reject_ubi</code> flag).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="scaling">3. Driver Level Scaling</h2>
      <p>UBI payments scale with the recipient's <strong>driver level</strong> up to a cap of level 400. The formula is:</p>

      <InsetText>
        <code>payment = min(base, driver_level × base × ubi_multiplier / 400)</code><br/>
        Lower-level drivers receive a proportionally smaller payment. At level 400 (or above) the full base amount is paid out.
      </InsetText>

      <h2 id="auto-repay">4. Loan Auto-Repayment</h2>
      <p>If a UBI recipient has an outstanding loan at Bank of ASEAN, the lesser of the UBI payment or the remaining loan balance is automatically deducted as repayment before the remainder is deposited.</p>

      <h2 id="frequency">5. Distribution Frequency</h2>
      <p>UBI runs as a <strong>scheduled task every 20 minutes</strong>. The system checks all online players and distributes payments in bulk. Payments are logged as <code>Universal Basic Income</code> (or <code>Government Salary</code> for government employees) in the financial ledger.</p>

    </div>
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-one-third">
      <Sidebar items={[
        { label: "Payment Rates", href: "#rates" },
        { label: "Eligibility", href: "#eligibility" },
        { label: "Driver Level Scaling", href: "#scaling" },
        { label: "Loan Auto-Repayment", href: "#auto-repay" },
        { label: "Distribution Frequency", href: "#frequency" },
      ]} />
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

</GovLayout>
